Question 1
Perform the following operations:
Create Department and Employee tables with proper constraints.
Insert the given records.
Display employee name, department name, and location.
Find employees earning more than the average salary.
Display the highest-paid employee from each department.
Create a view showing Employee Name, Department Name, and Salary.
Update salary by 10% for employees in the IT department.
Question 2
Perform the following:
Find departments having more than one employee.
Display the second highest salary.
Show employees who joined before 2022.
Create a stored procedure to fetch employees of a particular department.
Delete employees with salary less than ₹50,000.
Display total salary expenditure department-wise.
Create an index on Employee Name.


